For a game that's about one of the most interesting, and a bit funny/weird conflicts, depending on who you ask, I have to say I love it. The first mission when I had to stay alive until the truck warmed up had me a little on edge cause you had to juggle with which way they were coming from, their speed, and your reload time, so it had me on my toes. i'm not looking forward to the night mission ;-;

The only drawback I see is the 3rd person top view, it's clever, but in my opinion it can make things a little difficult, but I'll take what I get :) 

Final conclusion, I love the game, I like that people are actually taking their time to make games about certain historical events, even if they are weird/funny, as a history lover I can appreciate that,and if you are too, i recommend this game, who knows, you might like it. I hope these guys keep up the great work!
